  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Initiation Plan (PIP) will support the development of new ideas and initiatives toadvance/accelerate resilient, green and inclusive economic development. It houses the early phase ofUNDP&#x2019;s programming for climate change adaptation and resilience, biodiversity and circular economy,fund for responding to loss and damage (FRLD); where four areas - governance, gender and inclusion,sustainable finance and innovation and digital solutions - are integrated.</narrative>
  </description>
